<article class="env-lemma" id="02J2">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/02J2">Lemma <span data-tag="02J2">29.16.4</span>.</a> Let $S$ be a scheme. We have </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  S_{\text{ft-pts}} = \bigcup \nolimits _{U \subset S\text{ open}} U_0  \]
</div>
  <p> where $U_0$ is the set of closed points of $U$. Here we may let $U$ range over all opens or over all affine opens of $S$. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      Immediate from Lemma <a href="/tag/01TA" data-tag="01TA">29.16.1</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>